( C110 {owner 2026-11-05}: post_node_rhside_fixed / _free {manual Professional
  6.948, 6.949} are the signed sums of node_rhside over the prescribed / free
  nodes per principal dof; post_node_rhside_ratio {6.950} is, per principal
  dof, the mean |node_rhside| of the free nodes over that of the fixed nodes,
  the largest over the dofs. Same input as post_node_rhside_ratio_method1
  without the method record. Professional 02-08-2026: fixed -3.98859
  0.0908132, free 3.98859 -0.0908132, ratio 12.9442 {vely:
  1.17548/0.0908132}. Checked in scripts/build_safe.sh. )
